stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> queued: Storage event accepted and deduplicated
  queued --> running: atomic claim assigns lease
  running --> running: heartbeat renews lease
  running --> retry_wait: transient provider or infrastructure fault
  retry_wait --> queued: backoff expires, attempts remain
  running --> harvested: valid CFDI + ingest result + read-back confirmed
  running --> business_exception: account/access requires human recovery
  running --> failed: invalid input or retry cap reached
  running --> queued: expired lease recovered after worker crash
  business_exception --> queued: operator resolves cause and explicitly requeues
  failed --> queued: operator corrects input and explicitly requeues
  harvested --> [*]

  note right of business_exception
    Missing credential is not authorization to register an account.
    Preserve the source object and a safe next action.
  end note
  note right of running
    A single physical phone is a serialized resource.
    Do not let concurrent jobs contend for its UI state.
  end note